## 2. Roles & Permissions

| Role | Description |
|---|---|
| **Super Admin** | Full system access: manage admins, global settings, question bank, certificate templates, all users. |
| **Admin / Content Manager** | Create/edit mock tests, question sets, reading/listening/writing/speaking content, review flagged AI scores, issue/revoke certificates. |
| **Instructor (optional role)** | Reviews Writing/Speaking submissions, overrides AI band score, leaves feedback. |
| **Student (User)** | Takes mock tests/practice, views progress, receives certificate, manages profile/subscription. |
| **Guest** | Limited access — can view landing page, sample questions, pricing; must register to attempt tests. |

Role-based access is enforced via JWT claims + NestJS Guards (`RolesGuard`) on every endpoint, and route-level guards in Next.js middleware. The same guard/permission model will extend to a mobile client (navigation guard + context) when that phase begins.

