## 5. Data Model (Core Entities)

- **User** — id, name, email, passwordHash, role, targetBand, examDate, moduleType (Academic/General), subscriptionTier, createdAt
- **TestSet** — id, title, type (Listening/Reading/Writing/Speaking/Full), timeLimit, isMock, createdBy
- **Question** — id, testSetId, skill, type, content(json), correctAnswer(json), audioUrl/imageUrl, difficulty
- **Attempt** — id, userId, testSetId, startedAt, submittedAt, status, rawAnswers(json)
- **Score** — id, attemptId, skill, criteriaBreakdown(json), bandScore, scoredBy (AI/instructor), confidence
- **Certificate** — id, userId, certificateNumber, overallBand, issuedAt, status (active/revoked), templateId
- **VocabularyItem / Flashcard** — id, word, definition, sourcePassageId, userId (for saved words)
- **Notification** — id, userId, type, payload, readAt
- **AgentRun** — id, agentType, triggerType, inputRef, status (queued/running/done/failed), output(json), confidence, retryCount, costTokens, durationMs, startedAt, completedAt
- **AuditLog** — id, actorId, action, targetType, targetId, timestamp

