## 6. User Flows

### 6.1 Student — First-Time Flow
1. Land on marketing page → Sign up (email or OAuth).
2. Verify email → Onboarding wizard (target band, exam date, module type, diagnostic quiz).
3. Land on Dashboard with personalized recommendation.
4. Take first practice question or full mock test.
5. View instant results (Listening/Reading) or "scoring in progress" (Writing/Speaking, async AI job).
6. Get notified when AI score is ready → review feedback.
7. Repeat across skills → hit certificate milestone → certificate auto-generated → notified → download/share.

### 6.2 Student — Full Mock Test Flow
1. Dashboard → "Start Full Mock Test."
2. Instructions screen (exam rules, timer info) → Consent/Start.
3. Listening section (timed, audio, auto-advance) → Reading section (timed) → short break screen → Writing Task 1 & 2 (timed, editor) → Speaking (recorded, part 1/2/3 prompts, timed per part).
4. Submit → Listening/Reading scored instantly; Writing/Speaking queued for AI scoring (BullMQ job).
5. Results dashboard updates as each section completes scoring; overall band computed once all 4 are in.
6. If milestone met → Certificate generation triggered.

### 6.3 Admin — Content Creation Flow
1. Login → Admin panel.
2. Content → New Test Set → choose skill/type → add questions (bulk import or manual builder) → attach audio/images → set correct answers/rubric → publish.
3. Optionally assign to a "Course" or "Certificate Milestone."

### 6.4 Admin — Review & Certificate Flow
1. Review queue shows AI-scored Writing/Speaking below confidence threshold.
2. Admin/instructor listens/reads submission, adjusts band + leaves comment → saves → student notified.
3. Certificates tab → filter by pending/issued/revoked → manually issue, revoke, or reissue with reason (audit-logged).

### 6.5 Public — Certificate Verification Flow
1. Anyone opens `/verify/:certificateId` (from PDF QR code or shared link).
2. System shows: learner name (partial/masked per privacy setting), band, issue date, status (valid/revoked) — no login required.

